{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 47,
  "name": "泽水困",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06735",
              "text": "困：亨；贞，大人吉，无咎；有言不信。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06735",
                "bodyParagraph": 6671
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06736",
              "text": "【白话】《困卦》象征困顿：亨通；占卜结果表明，神通广大的大人物可以获得吉祥，没有灾祸；此时许下的诺言很难令人相信。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06736",
                "bodyParagraph": 6672
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06737",
              "text": "《象》曰：泽无水，困；君子以致命遂志。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06737",
                "bodyParagraph": 6673
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06738",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《困卦》的卦象是坎（水）下兑（泽）上，为泽中无水之表象，象征困顿；作为君子应该身处穷困而不气馁，为实现自己的志向，不惜牺牲生命。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06738",
                "bodyParagraph": 6674
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06740",
              "text": "困卦兑上坎下，泽中无水，象征被环境所困，才智难以施展。“亨，贞，大人吉，无咎；有言不信”，指出困局中空谈难被人相信，唯有坚守正道，方能转危为机。《象》说“君子以致命遂志”，强调困厄中不改志向。事业、求名需要耐心；经商不可急功近利，切忌因焦虑而采取不当手段。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06740",
                "bodyParagraph": 6676
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06743",
              "text": "初六，臀困于株木，入于幽谷，三岁不觌。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06743",
                "bodyParagraph": 6679
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06744",
              "text": "【白话】初六，屁股卡在木桩上坐立不安，退隐到幽深的山谷里，三年不与外人相见。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06744",
                "bodyParagraph": 6680
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06745",
              "text": "《象》曰：“入于幽谷”，幽不明也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06745",
                "bodyParagraph": 6681
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06746",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“退隐到幽深的山谷里”，就是进入荒僻陰暗不见天日的地方，比喻处境极其困难，看不到一线希望。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06746",
                "bodyParagraph": 6682
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06748",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06748",
                "bodyParagraph": 6684
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06750",
              "text": "初六爻动，变为第58卦《兑卦》（兑为泽）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06750",
                "bodyParagraph": 6686
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06752",
              "text": "初六“臀困于株木，入于幽谷，三岁不觌”，表示被困于幽暗处、看不到出路。应承认眼下条件有限，守候转机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06752",
                "bodyParagraph": 6688
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06755",
              "text": "九二，困于酒食，朱绂方来，利用享祀；征凶，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06755",
                "bodyParagraph": 6691
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06756",
              "text": "【白话】九二，为醇酒美食所困扰而穷于应付，高官厚禄就将来到，应当用丰美的酒食祭祀神灵；出兵征战即使遇到凶险，也不会受到伤害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06756",
                "bodyParagraph": 6692
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06757",
              "text": "《象》曰：“困于酒食”，中有庆也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06757",
                "bodyParagraph": 6693
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06758",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“为醇酒美食所困扰而穷于应付”，并不是很可怕的事，只要内心坚持中道，纯正而有主见，就会有喜庆之事到来。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06758",
                "bodyParagraph": 6694
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06760",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06760",
                "bodyParagraph": 6696
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06762",
              "text": "九二爻动，变为第45卦《萃卦》（泽地萃）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06762",
                "bodyParagraph": 6698
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06764",
              "text": "九二“困于酒食，朱绂方来”，内在有才而不得施展，但外来援助或名位可期。“征凶”戒躁进，“无咎”可守待时。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06764",
                "bodyParagraph": 6700
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06767",
              "text": "六三，困于石，据于蒺藜；入于其宫，不见其妻，凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06767",
                "bodyParagraph": 6703
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06768",
              "text": "【白话】六三，困在石头下面，站在蒺藜之上；刚刚回到家中，又不见了自家妻室，凶险接二连三来到身边。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06768",
                "bodyParagraph": 6704
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06769",
              "text": "《象》曰：“据于蒺藜”，乘刚也；“入于其宫，不见其妻”，不祥也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06769",
                "bodyParagraph": 6705
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06770",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“站在蒺藜之上”，就是说陰柔凌驾在陽刚之上，情形就像是站在刺人的蒺藜上面，十分困窘。“刚刚回到家中，又不见了自家妻室”，说明祸不单行，已经饱受各种困扰，家门又惨遭不幸，实在是不吉祥的兆头。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06770",
                "bodyParagraph": 6706
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06772",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06772",
                "bodyParagraph": 6708
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06774",
              "text": "六三爻动，变为第28卦《大过卦》（泽风大过）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06774",
                "bodyParagraph": 6710
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06776",
              "text": "六三“困于石，据于蒺藜；入于其宫，不见其妻，凶”，以进退受阻、归家不安描写多重困境，特别提示做事要量力而行。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06776",
                "bodyParagraph": 6712
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06779",
              "text": "九四，来徐徐，困于金车，吝，有终。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06779",
                "bodyParagraph": 6715
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06780",
              "text": "【白话】九四，慢腾腾姗姗来迟，原来是被一辆豪华金车所困而不能脱身，会遇到一些困难，但最终会有好的结局。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06780",
                "bodyParagraph": 6716
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06781",
              "text": "《象》曰：“来徐徐”，志在下也；虽不当位，有与也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06781",
                "bodyParagraph": 6717
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06782",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“慢腾腾姗姗来迟”，表明没有飞黄腾达的奢望，一心想着屈尊下士来摆脱困境；虽然所处地位不妥当，不能胜任职务，却能得到志同道合者的支持。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06782",
                "bodyParagraph": 6718
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06784",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06784",
                "bodyParagraph": 6720
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06786",
              "text": "九四爻动，变为第29卦《坎卦》（坎为水）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06786",
                "bodyParagraph": 6722
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06788",
              "text": "九四“来徐徐，困于金车，吝，有终”，表示道路不顺、行动迟缓，但有相助而能善终。救助他人前应量力，并寻求合作。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06788",
                "bodyParagraph": 6724
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06791",
              "text": "九五，劓刖，困于赤绂；乃徐有说，利用祭祀。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06791",
                "bodyParagraph": 6727
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06792",
              "text": "【白话】九五，用割鼻子剁脚的酷刑治理天下，就会被自身所处的尊贵地位所困扰；但慢慢地又会走出困境，应当虔诚地祭祀神灵，才能保证前景顺利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06792",
                "bodyParagraph": 6728
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06793",
              "text": "《象》曰：“劓刖”，志未得也；“乃徐有说”，以中直也；“利用祭祀”，受福也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06793",
                "bodyParagraph": 6729
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06794",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“用割鼻子剁脚的酷刑治理天下”，表明处在至高无上的显赫位置上，如果不恤民命，滥施酷刑，就会落得个孤家寡人，被困在众叛亲离的尊位上，摆脱困境走向亨通的志向就难以实现。“慢慢地又会走出困境”，完全是由于坚守中庸、保持正直品德的结果；“应当虔诚地祭祀神灵，才能保证前景顺利”，就是说诚心敬神，可以时时接受神灵恩赐的福分，求得吉祥顺利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06794",
                "bodyParagraph": 6730
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06796",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06796",
                "bodyParagraph": 6732
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06798",
              "text": "九五爻动，变为第40卦《解卦》（雷水解）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06798",
                "bodyParagraph": 6734
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06800",
              "text": "九五“劓刖，困于赤绂；乃徐有说”，在尊位上却遭约束，提醒人不能因位高而滥用威权，要持中守正，逐渐化解困境。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06800",
                "bodyParagraph": 6736
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06803",
              "text": "上六，困于葛藟，于臲卼；曰动悔有悔，征吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06803",
                "bodyParagraph": 6739
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06804",
              "text": "【白话】上六，困在纷乱缠绕的葛藤中，身临摇摇欲坠的山石之间，假如说动辄会后悔，那就早点行动，让悔悟快点到来，向前进军会迎来吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06804",
                "bodyParagraph": 6740
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06805",
              "text": "《象》曰：“困于葛藟”，未当也；“动悔有悔”，吉行也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06805",
                "bodyParagraph": 6741
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-06806",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“困在纷乱缠绕的葛藤中”，说明所处位置不是十分妥当，脚下尚有难以解脱的绊索，因此困难重重。“假如说动辄会后悔，那就早点行动，让悔悟快点到来”，这是十分明智的举动，早些悔悟，把危险抛在身后，前途就会无比吉祥顺利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06806",
                "bodyParagraph": 6742
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06808",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06808",
                "bodyParagraph": 6744
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06810",
              "text": "上六爻动，变为第6卦《讼卦》（天水讼）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06810",
                "bodyParagraph": 6746
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-06812",
              "text": "上六“困于葛藟，于臲卼”，处于纠缠不清的危险高处。困到极点时懂得悔改、主动调整策略，才有“征吉”可言。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-06812",
                "bodyParagraph": 6748
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
